{"id":"alors","lemma":"alors","pos":"adv","rank":61,"glosses":["then (at that time)","so, hence (as a consequence)"],"ipa":"/a.lɔʁ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/2/28/Fr-alors.ogg/Fr-alors.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Où vais-je, alors ?","en":"Where do I go then?","words":[{"g":"where"},{"g":"to go","l":"aller"},{"g":"I"},null]},{"text":"Si pas maintenant, alors quand ?","en":"If not now, then when?","words":[{"g":"if, whether"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"now, currently"},null,{"g":"when"}]},{"text":"Alors, pourquoi es-tu ici ?","en":"So, why are you here?","words":[null,{"g":"why"},{"g":"are","l":"être"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"here"}]},{"text":"Ce sera alors trop tard.","en":"It'll be too late then.","words":[{"g":"this / it"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},null,{"g":"too"},{"g":"late"}]},{"text":"Je vais le lui dire alors.","en":"I'll tell him so then.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to go","l":"aller"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"him, he, it"},{"g":"to say, to tell"},null]}]}